mc\u0131 K\u0131lavuzu (Ekim 2019)<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/ms.hmb.gov.tr\/uploads\/2019\/10\/Alt\u0131n-Tahvili-Yat\u0131r\u0131mc\u0131-K\u0131lavuzu-Kurumsal-Yat\u0131r\u0131mc\u0131lar-Ekim-2019.pdf\">Alt\u0131n Tahvili Yat\u0131r\u0131mc\u0131 K\u0131lavuzu (Ekim 2019)<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/ms.hmb.gov.tr\/uploads\/2019\/02\/Alt\u0131na-Dayal\u0131-Kira-Sertifikas\u0131-Yat\u0131r\u0131mc\u0131-K\u0131lavuzu-Kurumsal-Yat\u0131r\u0131mc\u0131lar.pdf\">Alt\u0131na Dayal\u0131 Kira Sertifikas\u0131 Yat\u0131r\u0131mc\u0131 K\u0131lavuzu (\u015eubat 2019)<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/ms.hmb.gov.tr\/uploads\/2019\/02\/Alt\u0131n-Tahvili-Yat\u0131r\u0131mc\u0131-K\u0131lavuzu-Kurumsal-Yat\u0131r\u0131mc\u0131lar.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Alt\u0131n Tahvili Yat\u0131r\u0131mc\u0131 K\u0131lavuzu (\u015eubat 2019)<\/a><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<li>Bireysel Yat\u0131r\u0131mc\u0131lar\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/ms.hmb.gov.tr\/uploads\/2019\/01\/Alt\u0131n-Tahvili-Yat\u0131r\u0131mc\u0131-K\u0131lavuzu-Aral\u0131k-2018.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Alt\u0131n Tahvili Yat\u0131r\u0131mc\u0131 K\u0131lavuzu<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/ms.hmb.gov.tr\/uploads\/2019\/01\/Alt\u0131na-Dayal\u0131-Kira-Sertifikas\u0131-Yat\u0131r\u0131mc\u0131-K\u0131lavuzu-Aral\u0131k-2018.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Alt\u0131na Dayal\u0131 Kira Sertifikas\u0131 Yat\u0131r\u0131mc\u0131 K\u0131lavuzu<\/a><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Bireysel Yat\u0131r\u0131mc\u0131lara Y\u00f6nelik Gelire Endeksli Senetler Gelire Endeksli Senet Yat\u0131r\u0131mc\u0131 K\u0131lavuzu Gelire Endeksli Senet Has\u0131lat Endeksi Gelire Endeksli Senet Kupon Oran\u0131 TLREF&#8217;e Endeksli Devlet \u0130\u00e7 Bor\u00e7lanma Senetleri TLREF Yat\u0131r\u0131mc\u0131 K\u0131lavuzu Piyasa Yap\u0131c\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131 Sistemi Piyasa Yap\u0131c\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131 S\u00f6zle\u015fmesi (2026) Piyasa Yap\u0131c\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131 S\u00f6zle\u015fmesi (2025) Piyasa Yap\u0131c\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131 S\u00f6zle\u015fmesi (2024) Piyasa Yap\u0131c\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131 S\u00f6zle\u015fmesi (2021-2023) Piyasa Yap\u0131c\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131 S\u00f6zle\u015fmesi (2020) Piyasa Yap\u0131c\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131 [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"parent":0},{"id":74447,"date":"2023-06-25T19:17:29","modified":"2026-09-28T09:09:22","slug":"osman-celik","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/api.hmb.gov.tr\/osman-celik\/","title":{"rendered":"Osman \u00c7EL\u0130K"},"content":{"rendered":"<h3 class=\"mb-primary h5 font-weight-bold\">Osman \u00c7EL\u0130K<\/h3>\n<div><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"img-responsive float-lg-left ml-lg-3 mb-lg-3 img-bakan\" src=\"https:\/\/ms.hmb.gov.tr\/uploads\/2026\/09\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-09-28-at-07.15.33_2-d764f7a5e737ebd4.jpg\" width=\"315\" height=\"248\" \/><\/div>\n<div><\/div>\n<div class=\"text-justify\">\n<div class=\"col-12 pt-2\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<p>Say\u0131n Bakan Yard\u0131mc\u0131s\u0131 Osman \u00c7elik, 1964 y\u0131l\u0131nda Erzincan\/Kemaliye\u2019de do\u011fdu. Orta Do\u011fu Teknik \u00dcniversitesi \u0130ktisadi ve \u0130dari Bilimler Fak\u00fcltesi Ekonomi B\u00f6l\u00fcm\u00fcnden mezun oldu. 1986-1987 y\u0131llar\u0131 aras\u0131nda Devlet \u0130statistik Enstit\u00fcs\u00fc\u2019nde Ekonomist olarak \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131. 1988-1995 y\u0131llar\u0131 aras\u0131nda Faisal Finans Kurumu Proje De\u011ferlendirme ve Haz\u0131rlama M\u00fcd\u00fcrl\u00fc\u011f\u00fcnde Uzman ve Ba\u015f Uzman olarak g\u00f6rev ald\u0131. 1995-1999 y\u0131llar\u0131nda \u0130hlas Finans Kurumunda Proje ve Pazarlama M\u00fcd\u00fcrl\u00fc\u011f\u00fc g\u00f6revini s\u00fcrd\u00fcrd\u00fc.<\/p>\n<p>2000-2005 d\u00f6neminde Anadolu Finans Kurumu Genel M\u00fcd\u00fcr Yard\u0131mc\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131 g\u00f6revini y\u00fcr\u00fctt\u00fc. 2006-2015 y\u0131llar\u0131 aras\u0131nda T\u00fcrkiye Finans Kat\u0131l\u0131m Bankas\u0131nda s\u0131ras\u0131yla Krediler\u2019den ve Ticari Bankac\u0131l\u0131k\u2019tan sorumlu Genel M\u00fcd\u00fcr Yard\u0131mc\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131, Haziran 2015 itibar\u0131yla da Genel M\u00fcd\u00fcrl\u00fck g\u00f6revlerini \u00fcstlendi.<\/p>\n<p>Say\u0131n \u00c7elik, 29 Haziran 2016 tarihinde T.C. Hazine M\u00fcste\u015farl\u0131\u011f\u0131 g\u00f6revine atand\u0131. Hazine M\u00fcste\u015farl\u0131\u011f\u0131 d\u00f6neminde \u0130slam Kalk\u0131nma Bankas\u0131 \u0130cra Kurulu \u00dcyeli\u011fi yapt\u0131 ve G-20 T\u00fcrkiye Sherpas\u0131 olarak g\u00f6rev ald\u0131. Ayn\u0131 d\u00f6nemde D\u00fcnya Bankas\u0131, EBRD, Asya Kalk\u0131nma Bankas\u0131, Karadeniz Ticaret ve Kalk\u0131nma Bankas\u0131, Ecobank, Asya Altyap\u0131 Yat\u0131r\u0131m Bankas\u0131 Guvern\u00f6rl\u00fcklerinin yan\u0131 s\u0131ra FSB, Finansal \u0130stikrar Komitesi, Faizsiz Finansman Koordinasyon Kurulu ve KOSGEB \u0130cra Kurulu \u00fcyeli\u011fi g\u00f6revlerinde de bulundu.<\/p>\n<p>2017-2021 y\u0131llar\u0131 aras\u0131nda T\u00fcrk Eximbank Y\u00f6netim Kurulu Ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131, Y\u00f6netim Kurulu \u00dcyeli\u011fi ve Denetim Komitesi Ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131 yapan Say\u0131n \u00c7elik, Ekim 2018 tarihinden itibaren Vak\u0131f Kat\u0131l\u0131m Bankas\u0131 A.\u015e.\u2019de Y\u00f6netim Kurulu \u00dcyesi ve Kredi Komitesi Ba\u015fkan\u0131 olarak g\u00f6rev yapt\u0131. 25 Mart 2022 tarihinde Vak\u0131f Kat\u0131l\u0131m Bankas\u0131 Genel M\u00fcd\u00fcr\u00fc olarak g\u00f6revlendirildi.<\/p>\n<p>Say\u0131n Osman \u00c7elik 21 Haziran 2023 tarihinde Hazine ve Maliye Bakan Yard\u0131mc\u0131s\u0131 olarak atanm\u0131\u015f olup halen bu g\u00f6revine devam etmektedir.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"col-12 pt-2\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Osman \u00c7EL\u0130K Say\u0131n Bakan Yard\u0131mc\u0131s\u0131 Osman \u00c7elik, 1964 y\u0131l\u0131nda Erzincan\/Kemaliye\u2019de do\u011fdu. Orta Do\u011fu Teknik \u00dcniversitesi \u0130ktisadi ve \u0130dari Bilimler Fak\u00fcltesi Ekonomi B\u00f6l\u00fcm\u00fcnden mezun oldu. 1986-1987 y\u0131llar\u0131 aras\u0131nda Devlet \u0130statistik Enstit\u00fcs\u00fc\u2019nde Ekonomist olarak \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131. 1988-1995 y\u0131llar\u0131 aras\u0131nda Faisal Finans Kurumu Proje De\u011ferlendirme ve Haz\u0131rlama M\u00fcd\u00fcrl\u00fc\u011f\u00fcnde Uzman ve Ba\u015f Uzman olarak g\u00f6rev ald\u0131. 1995-1999 y\u0131llar\u0131nda \u0130hlas Finans [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"parent":0},{"id":26578,"date":"2019-06-13T16:00:40","modified":"2026-09-18T15:15:53","slug":"kamu-finansmani-genel-mudurlugu-teskilat-semasi","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/api.hmb.gov.tr\/kamu-finansmani-genel-mudurlugu-teskilat-semasi\/","title":{"rendered":"Te\u015fkilat \u015eemas\u0131"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"img-fluid\" src=\"https:\/\/ms.hmb.gov.tr\/uploads\/2026\/09\/Kamu-Finansmani-Teskilat-Semasi_18.09.2026-6fbd0d2562725bdb.jpg\" alt=\"KAF te\u015fkilat \u015femas\u0131\" \/><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"","protected":false},"parent":0},{"id":10033,"date":"2018-12-26T11:53:05","modified":"2026-09-18T13:13:23","slug":"paydaslar-mski","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/api.hmb.gov.tr\/yetkili-muessese-bilgi-sistemi\/paydaslar-mski\/","title":{"rendered":"Yetkili M\u00fcessese Unvan ve \u0130leti\u015fim Bilgileri"},"content":{"rendered":"<ul>\n<li>Yetkili M\u00fcessese Unvan ve \u0130leti\u015fim Bilgileri i\u00e7in <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/ms.hmb.gov.tr\/uploads\/2026\/09\/Paydaslar-18.09.2026-40930fc4a7284657.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">T\u0131klay\u0131n\u0131z.<\/a><\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Yetkili M\u00fcessese Unvan ve \u0130leti\u015fim Bilgileri i\u00e7in T\u0131klay\u0131n\